rue\"><path d=\"M20.985 12.486a9 9 0 1 1-9.473-9.472c.405-.022.617.46.402.803a6 6 0 0 0 8.268 8.268c.344-.215.825-.004.803.401\"></path></svg></span></button><a class=\"hidden rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-default)] bg-[var(--surface-high)] px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.11em] text-[var(--text-primary)] transition hover:bg-[var(--surface-highest)] md:inline-flex\" href=\"/verifier\">Verify Receipt</a><a class=\"brand-gradient rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-white\" href=\"/admin/login\">Open Admin</a></div></div></header><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 pb-16 pt-28 md:px-10\"><section class=\"grid min-h-[calc(100vh-7rem)] gap-14 py-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr,0.8fr] lg:items-center\"><div class=\"reveal-up reveal-slow reveal-delay-1\"><p class=\"mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[var(--primary)]/25 bg-[var(--primary)]/10 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[var(--tertiary)]\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400\"></span>Sovereign Vault Online</p><h1 class=\"text-[3.2rem] font-extrabold leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.04em] md:text-[4.9rem]\">The Sovereign Vault<br/>of Digital Democracy</h1><p class=\"mt-7 max-w-2xl text-xl leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Secure, immutable, and transparent election infrastructure for institutions that demand operational clarity and cryptographic trust.</p><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a class=\"brand-gradient rounded-2xl px-8 py-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-white\" href=\"/admin/login\">Explore the Network</a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/6 px-8 py-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-white transition hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/verifier\">Verify Receipt</a></div></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto h-[420px] w-full max-w-[460px] reveal-up reveal-slow reveal-delay-2\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-[var(--primary)]/30 animate-[spin_28s_linear_infinite]\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-9 rounded-full border border-[var(--secondary)]/20 animate-[spin_24s_linear_infinite_reverse]\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-20 rounded-full border border-white/10\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 grid place-items-center\"><div class=\"glass-panel ghost-border relative w-[250px] rounded-[2.25rem] p-8 text-center\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-4 -top-4 grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-full brand-gradient shadow-[0_0_26px_rgba(79,110,247,0.6)]\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-white\">check_circle</span></div><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[88px] text-[var(--primary)]\" style=\"font-variation-settings:&quot;FILL&quot; 1\">shield_lock</span><p class=\"mt-5 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.24em] text-[var(--tertiary)]\">ENCRYPT_SHA256</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"architecture\" class=\"py-28 reveal-up reveal-slow reveal-delay-1\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-14 max-w-3xl text-center\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--tertiary)]\">Core Infrastructure</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight\">The Architecture of Trust</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-lg text-[var(--text-muted)]\">The ballot box is rebuilt as a distributed cryptographic primitive with end-to-end assurance.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2\"><article class=\"glass-panel ghost-border rounded-[2rem] p-8\"><div class=\"mb-8 grid h-[280px] place-items-center rounded-[1.6rem] border border-white/10 bg-[var(--surface-container)]\"><div class=\"grid place-items-center\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[66px] text-[var(--primary)]\">lock</span><p class=\"mt-3 rounded-lg border border-[var(--primary)]/25 bg-[var(--primary)]/10 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--tertiary)]\">AES-256 GCM</p></div></div><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-bold\">E2E Encryption</h3><p class=\"mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Every vote remains private from device to tally with layered cryptographic wrapping.</p></article><article class=\"glass-panel ghost-border rounded-[2rem] p-8\"><div class=\"mb-8 grid h-[280px] place-items-center rounded-[1.6rem] border border-white/10 bg-[var(--surface-container)]\"><div class=\"grid gap-3 text-center\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid w-[180px] grid-cols-2 gap-3\"><div class=\"h-12 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5\"></div><div class=\"h-12 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5\"></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto h-8 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-[var(--primary)]/60 to-transparent\"></div><p class=\"mx-auto rounded-xl brand-gradient px-4 py-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-white\">ROOT HASH</p></div></div><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-bold\">Merkle Immutability</h3><p class=\"mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Tampering with one record breaks proof integrity across the chain, making manipulation detectable.</p></article></div></section><section id=\"security\" class=\"py-28 reveal-up reveal-slow reveal-delay-2\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-14 max-w-3xl text-center\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--tertiary)]\">Security Standards</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight\">Hardened For Resilience</h2></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\"><article class=\"glass-panel ghost-border rounded-[1.6rem] p-8 transition hover:bg-white/6\"><div class=\"mb-8 grid h-14 w-14 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-[var(--primary)]/12 text-[var(--primary)]\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-3xl\">shield_lock</span></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight\">Military Grade Security</h3><p class=\"mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Hardened cryptographic controls protect vote integrity from submission through final publication.</p></article><article class=\"glass-panel ghost-border rounded-[1.6rem] p-8 transition hover:bg-white/6\"><div class=\"mb-8 grid h-14 w-14 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-[var(--secondary)]/12 text-[var(--secondary)]\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-3xl\">monitoring</span></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight\">Real-Time Operations</h3><p class=\"mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Active telemetry and anomaly watch keep election teams aware of suspicious patterns in real time.</p></article><article class=\"glass-panel ghost-border rounded-[1.6rem] p-8 transition hover:bg-white/6\"><div class=\"mb-8 grid h-14 w-14 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-[var(--tertiary)]/12 text-[var(--tertiary)]\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-3xl\">verified_user</span></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight\">Public Auditability</h3><p class=\"mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Receipts and verification workflows make trust measurable for every participant and observer.</p></article></div></section><section id=\"verifier\" class=\"py-28 reveal-up reveal-slow reveal-delay-2\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight\">Trust, But Verify.</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-5 max-w-3xl text-xl text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Every ballot receipt can be validated through the public verifier route with immutable audit references.</p></div><article class=\"glass-panel ghost-border relative mx-auto mt-12 max-w-4xl rounded-[2.4rem] p-8 md:p-12\"><div class=\"absolute -top-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full border border-[var(--primary)]/35 bg-[var(--surface-container)] px-5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-[var(--tertiary)]\">PUBLIC_VERIFIER_V2</div><div class=\"space-y-8 text-left\"><div><label class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Ballot Receipt ID</label><div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-4 md:flex-row\"><div class=\"flex-1 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[var(--surface-container)] px-5 py-4 font-mono text-[var(--primary)]\">SV-2026-X9F2-K881-LQ82</div><a class=\"brand-gradient rounded-xl px-8 py-4 text-center text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-white\" href=\"/verifier\">Verify</a></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-black/25 p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><p class=\"text-sm font-bold\">Verification Status</p><span class=\"rounded-full border border-emerald-500/25 bg-emerald-500/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-300\">Validated</span></div><div class=\"mt-5 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2\"><div><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Block Height</p><p class=\"mt-1 font-mono text-sm\">18,922,104</p></div><div><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Merkle Proof</p><p class=\"mt-1 font-mono text-sm\">0x88e1...f22a</p></div></div></div></div></article></section><section class=\"py-28 text-center reveal-up reveal-slow reveal-delay-3\"><h2 class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl text-5xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight md:text-6xl\">Ready to secure your next election?</h2><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4\"><a class=\"brand-gradient rounded-[1.2rem] px-10 py-5 text-lg font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-white\" href=\"/admin/login\">Contact Operations</a><a href=\"#architecture\" class=\"rounded-[1.2rem] border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-10 py-5 text-lg font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-white/10\">Review Architecture</a></div></section></div><footer class=\"relative border-t border-[var(--border-default)] bg-[var(--surface-low)] py-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-10\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-2xl font-extrabold text-[var(--text-primary)]\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[var(--primary)]\">security</span>SecureVote</div><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Cryptographic governance infrastructure for trusted digital elections and accountable institutional voting.</p><div class=\"mt-7 flex items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[var(--border-default)] bg-[var(--surface-high)] text-[var(--text-secondary)] transition hover:bg-[var(--surface-highest)] hover:text-[var(--text-primary)]\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\">public</span></a><a href=\"#\" class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[var(--border-default)] bg-[var(--surface-high)] text-[var(--text-secondary)] transition hover:bg-[var(--surface-highest)] hover:text-[var(--text-primary)]\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\">alternate_email</span></a><a href=\"#\" class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[var(--border-default)] bg-[var(--surface-high)] text-[var(--text-secondary)] transition hover:bg-[var(--surface-highest)] hover:text-[var(--text-primary)]\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\">hub</span></a></div></div><div><p class=\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--text-primary)]\">Platform</p><ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)]\"><li><a href=\"#architecture\" class=\"transition hover:text-[var(--text-primary)]\">Architecture</a></li><li><a class=\"transition hover:text-[var(--text-primary)]\" href=\"/security\">Security Standards</a></li><li><a class=\"transition hover:text-[var(--text-primary)]\" href=\"/verifier\">Public Verifier</a></li><li><a class=\"transition hover:text-[var(--text-primary)]\" href=\"/admin/login\">Admin Portal</a></li><li><a class=\"transition hover:text-[var(--text-primary)]\" hre